{"unit":3,"no":12,"title":"You, your day and your work","blurb":"★ Review 1","VOCAB":[["be born","","родиться","туылу",""],["travel","","путешествовать","саяхаттау",""],["get up early","","вставать рано","ерте тұру",""],["do the housework","","делать работу по дому","үй жұмысын істеу",""],["hardly ever","","почти никогда","жоққа тән",""],["nurse","","медсестра","медбике",""],["journalist","","журналист","журналист",""],["salary","","зарплата","жалақы",""],["borrow","","взять взаймы","қарызға алу",""],["lend","","дать взаймы","қарызға беру",""],["niece","","племянница","жиен қыз",""],["nephew","","племянник","жиен ұл",""]],"SLIDES":[],"PICWORDS":["be born","travel","get up early","do the housework","hardly ever","nurse","journalist","salary","borrow","lend","niece","nephew"],"DEFS":[],"CTX":{},"COLLOC":{},"IMG":{},"NOTES":{},"TIMING":{},"tracks":{"1_13":"A1_L12_1_13.mp3","1_16":"A1_L12_1_16.mp3","8_15":"A1_L12_8_15.mp3","2_15":"A1_L12_2_15.mp3"},"SEGS":{"1_13":[3.72,null],"1_16":[3.65,null],"8_15":[3.62,null],"2_15":[3.77,null]},"html":"\n  <section class=\"stage on\" data-stage=\"Intro\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 1 &middot; Intro</div>\n      <h2>You, your day and your work</h2>\n      <p>Put Units 1–3 together: your story, your routine, your job — and the questions for all of them.</p>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"bubble\" style=\"margin-top:18px\" data-only=\"self\"><div class=\"blab\">In other words</div><div><b>How to study</b> — about 25 minutes. Nothing new today — everything is review.</div><div>Headphones on. This lesson has real audio — tap ▶ to listen.</div><div>If a task is hard, go back to that lesson after the review.</div></div>\n      <div class=\"bubble\" style=\"margin-top:18px\" data-only=\"group\"><div class=\"blab\">In other words</div><div><b>How this lesson works</b> — you work with a partner. Nothing new today — everything is review.</div><div>This lesson has real audio — tap ▶ to listen together.</div><div>If a task is hard, go back to that lesson after class.</div></div>\n      <div class=\"bubble\" style=\"margin-top:18px\" data-only=\"solo\"><div class=\"blab\">In other words</div><div><b>How this lesson works</b> — you work with your teacher. Nothing new today — everything is review.</div><div>This lesson has real audio — tap ▶ to listen together.</div><div>If a task is hard, go back to that lesson after class.</div></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Warm-up\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 2 &middot; Warm-up</div>\n      <h2>Warm-up</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">Eleven lessons behind you. Which can you do with your eyes closed?</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\">Tap the ones that feel easy now.</p>\n      <div class=\"grid3\" style=\"margin-top:16px\"><div class=\"card\"><b>🕰️</b> &nbsp;was / were</div><div class=\"card\"><b>📖</b> &nbsp;telling a story (went, had)</div><div class=\"card\"><b>❓</b> &nbsp;Did you…?</div><div class=\"card\"><b>🔁</b> &nbsp;he works, she goes</div><div class=\"card\"><b>🚫</b> &nbsp;don't / doesn't</div><div class=\"card\"><b>🙏</b> &nbsp;Could you…?</div></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Words\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 3 &middot; Words</div>\n      <h2>Words</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"vbar\">\n        <div class=\"instruction\" style=\"margin:0\">Read the words. Click a card to see an example.</div>\n        <label class=\"switch\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"trToggle\"><span class=\"track\"></span><span>Show translation</span></label>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"words\" id=\"words\"></div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">First — the key words of these units. Save the ones you want to keep.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\">Then: one word doesn't belong — choose it.</p>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l12s2t1\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">aunt · uncle · nephew · pilot\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">pilot</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">aunt</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">nephew</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">always · usually · cheap · never\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">always</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">cheap</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">never</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">chef · nurse · salary · journalist\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">chef</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">salary</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">nurse</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\">yesterday · last week · ago · every day\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">yesterday</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">every day</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">ago</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">5</span><span class=\"body\">get up · have a shower · go to bed · guest house\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">get up</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">go to bed</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">guest house</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">6</span><span class=\"body\">borrow · lend · pass · niece\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">borrow</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">pass</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">niece</button></div></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>pilot = job (others: family) · cheap = adjective (others: adverbs) · salary = money (others: jobs) · every day = present time · guest house = place · niece = family.</p></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Tenses\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 4 &middot; Tenses</div>\n      <h2>Tenses</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">One story, all your grammar. Choose the correct form.</div>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l12s3t1\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">I ___ born in 2001.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">were</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">was</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">did</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">Yesterday we ___ a great film.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">watch</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">watched</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">watches</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">Last summer I ___ to Türkiye with my family.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">went</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">goed</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">goes</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\">She ___ up at six every day.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">get</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">gets</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">was</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">5</span><span class=\"body\">He ___ like Mondays.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">doesn't</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">don't</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">didn't</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">6</span><span class=\"body\">___ you have a job? — Yes, I do.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">Do</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">Did</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">Was</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">7</span><span class=\"body\">Where ___ you go last summer?\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">did</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">do</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">was</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">8</span><span class=\"body\">They ___ at school together in 2010.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">are</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">is</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">were</button></div></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>Past of be → was/were · finished past → -ed / went · routine → gets, doesn't · questions → Do (now) / did (past).</p></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Clinic\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 5 &middot; Clinic</div>\n      <h2>Clinic</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">Six classic mistakes from Units 1–3. Choose the correct sentence.</div>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l12s4t1\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">❌ “She were happy yesterday.”\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">She was happy yesterday.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">She is were happy yesterday.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">She is was happy yesterday.</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">❌ “Did you went home early?”\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">Did you go home early?</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">Did you goed home early?</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">Did you gos home early?</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">❌ “He don't work here.”\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">He doesn't works here.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">He doesn't work here.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">He don't works here.</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\">❌ “I gets up at seven.”\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">I am get up at seven.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">I get up at seven.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">Did you go home early?</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">5</span><span class=\"body\">❌ “Where you live?”\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">Where do you live?</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">Where you do live?</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">Did you go home early?</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">6</span><span class=\"body\">❌ “Can I lend your pen?” (you want to take it)\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">Can I borrow your pen?</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">Can I borrowing your pen?</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">Can I borrows your pen?</button></div></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>she <b>was</b> · Did you <b>go</b> · he <b>doesn't</b> · I <b>get</b> (no -s) · Where <b>do</b> you live · you take → <b>borrow</b>.</p></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Register\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 6 &middot; Register</div>\n      <h2>Register</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">At the registration desk — the five questions.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\">Listen once. Then answer.</p>\n      <div class=\"player\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-audio segbtn\" onclick=\"playTrack('1_13',this)\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M8 5v14l11-7z\"/></svg> Play</button>\n        <div class=\"wave\"></div>\n        <div class=\"meta\"><b>Track 1.13 — registering for a course</b>Original coursebook recording</div>\n      </div>\n      <details class=\"gref\" style=\"margin-top:16px\"><summary>Show transcript</summary><div class=\"gref-body\">R: Hi. Can I help you? A: Yes, I'm here for the 'Create a Website' course. R: Oh yes, at six o'clock. What's your name? A: Antonio Russo. R: Ah, yes. Your name's here on the list. I just need some other details. What's your nationality? A: I'm Italian but my home is here in Toronto. R: OK, and what's your job? A: I'm a restaurant owner. R: Mmm… So, is the website for business or for fun? A: It's for business. R: For your restaurant? A: Yes, that's right. R: And, finally, what's your email address? A: It's antonio@russorest.com. R: Sorry, can you repeat that, please? A: Yes, Antonio — A-N-T-O-N-I-O — at russorest dot com. R: How do you spell russorest? A: R-U-double S-O-R-E-S-T. R: OK. Great. Thanks.</div></details>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l12s5t3\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">What's his name?\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">Antonio Russo</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">Antonio Russell</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">Anton Rossi</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">What's his nationality?\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">Canadian</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">Spanish</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">Italian</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">What's his job?\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">A restaurant owner</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">A website designer</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">A chef</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\">Is the website for business or for fun?\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">For business</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">For fun</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">For funs</button></div></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>Antonio Russo · Italian (home in Toronto) · restaurant owner · the website is for his restaurant — business.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"player\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-audio segbtn\" onclick=\"playTrack('1_16',this)\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M8 5v14l11-7z\"/></svg> Play</button>\n        <div class=\"wave\"></div>\n        <div class=\"meta\"><b>Track 1.16 — spelling the email address</b>Original coursebook recording</div>\n      </div>\n      <details class=\"gref\" style=\"margin-top:16px\"><summary>Show transcript</summary><div class=\"gref-body\">It's antonio@russorest.com. — Sorry, can you repeat that, please? — Yes, Antonio — A-N-T-O-N-I-O — at russorest dot com. — How do you spell russorest? — R-U-double S-O-R-E-S-T.</div></details>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l12s5t6\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">“Double S” means…\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">the letter S two metres tall</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">two letters S</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">at</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">“@” is read as…\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">dot</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">ats</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">at</button></div></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>double S = SS · @ = “at” · . = “dot”.</p></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Past?\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 7 &middot; Past?</div>\n      <h2>Past?</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">Present or past? The question tells you.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\">Listen to six questions. Choose what you hear.</p>\n      <div class=\"player\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-audio segbtn\" onclick=\"playTrack('8_15',this)\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M8 5v14l11-7z\"/></svg> Play</button>\n        <div class=\"wave\"></div>\n        <div class=\"meta\"><b>Track 8.15 — six mixed questions</b>Original coursebook recording</div>\n      </div>\n      <details class=\"gref\" style=\"margin-top:16px\"><summary>Show transcript</summary><div class=\"gref-body\">1 Do you have to work? (present) 2 How long did you live there? (past) 3 Do you speak the language? (present) 4 Did you like the city? (past) 5 What did you think of the transport system? (past) 6 Do the local people use buses? (present)</div></details>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l12s6t3\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">1 — “Do you have to work?” is about…\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">before (past)</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">now (present)</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">tomorrow (future)</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">2 — “How long did you live there?” is about…\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">before (past)</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">now (present)</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">tomorrow (future)</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">4 — “Did you like the city?” is about…\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">now (present)</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">before (past)</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">tomorrow (future)</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\">6 — “Do the local people use buses?” is about…\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">before (past)</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">now (present)</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">tomorrow (future)</button></div></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p><b>Do / Does</b> → present · <b>Did</b> → past. One little word changes the time.</p></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Meeting\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 8 &middot; Meeting</div>\n      <h2>Meeting</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">A business visitor arrives in Seoul.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\">One conversation — greetings, times, questions, requests. Listen once.</p>\n      <div class=\"player\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-audio segbtn\" onclick=\"playTrack('2_15',this)\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M8 5v14l11-7z\"/></svg> Play</button>\n        <div class=\"wave\"></div>\n        <div class=\"meta\"><b>Track 2.15 — welcome to Seoul</b>Original coursebook recording</div>\n      </div>\n      <details class=\"gref\" style=\"margin-top:16px\"><summary>Show transcript</summary><div class=\"gref-body\">Kim: So, welcome to Seoul, Mr Schmidt. Nice to meet you. Schmidt: Thank you, Mr Kim. Nice to meet you, too. K: How was your journey? S: It was fine, thanks. K: Good. I'd like to take you to dinner. Are you free tonight? S: Um… yes, I am. But what time is our first meeting tomorrow? K: It's at nine thirty. S: OK, that's fine, then. K: Would you like to go for dinner at Jinju Jip? They do very good Korean soup there… S: Yes, that sounds nice. What time do you want to eat? K: Well, I usually go at about midnight. S: Er… I'm sorry, but I'm usually in bed at that time. Can we go a bit earlier? K: OK, no problem. It's open 24 hours. Let's go at half past nine. K: And do you want to do some shopping while you're here? S: Yes, I'd love to. K: Great! Let's do that after dinner. S: After dinner? What time do the shops close? K: Oh, very late! Some shops close at 5 a.m. People say that in Seoul, everything is open all the time!</div></details>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l12s7t3\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">How was Mr Schmidt's journey?\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">It was terrible.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">It was fine.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">It were terrible.</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">What time is the first meeting tomorrow?\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">At nine thirty</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">At half past nine in the evening</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">At midnight</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">When does Mr Kim usually eat dinner?\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">At about midnight</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">At six o'clock</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">At nine thirty</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\">When do some shops in Seoul close?\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">At 5 a.m.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">At 5 p.m.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">They never open</button></div></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>The journey was fine · meeting at <b>nine thirty</b> · Mr Kim eats at about <b>midnight</b>(!) · some shops close at <b>5 a.m.</b></p></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Write\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 9 &middot; Write</div>\n      <h2>Write</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-only=\"self\">Write your complete introduction — everything from Units 1–3.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-only=\"self\">8–10 sentences: your story, your routine, your work, one past weekend.</p>\n      <div class=\"bubble cy\" style=\"margin-top:20px\" data-only=\"self\"><div class=\"blab\">Useful language</div><ul><li>I was born in…</li><li>When I was a child…</li><li>I get up at… and I usually…</li><li>I work as a… / I study…</li><li>I don't…</li><li>Last weekend I went…</li></ul></div>\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-only=\"group\">The registration desk — and the small talk after it.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-only=\"group\">One of you works at the desk. The other registers. Then swap.</p>\n      <div class=\"bubble cy\" style=\"margin-top:20px\" data-only=\"group\"><div class=\"blab\">Useful language</div><ul><li>What's your name? How do you spell that?</li><li>What's your job?</li><li>What time do you start work?</li><li>Do you like your job?</li><li>Where did you go on your last holiday?</li><li>Sorry, can you repeat that?</li></ul></div>\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-only=\"solo\">The registration desk — and the small talk after it.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-only=\"solo\">One of you works at the desk. The other registers. Then swap roles.</p>\n      <div class=\"bubble cy\" style=\"margin-top:20px\" data-only=\"solo\"><div class=\"blab\">Useful language</div><ul><li>What's your name? How do you spell that?</li><li>What's your job?</li><li>What time do you start work?</li><li>Do you like your job?</li><li>Where did you go on your last holiday?</li><li>Sorry, can you repeat that?</li></ul></div>\n      <div class=\"bubble\" style=\"margin-top:18px\" data-only=\"group\"><div class=\"blab\">In other words</div><div><b>Step 1</b> — the receptionist asks the five questions: name (and spelling!), nationality, job, why you are here, email address.</div><div><b>Step 2</b> — small talk: ask about their day (What time do you…?), their work (Do you like…?) and their last holiday (Where did you go?).</div><div><b>Step 3</b> — swap roles. Then tell another pair TWO things about your partner.</div></div>\n      <div class=\"bubble\" style=\"margin-top:18px\" data-only=\"solo\"><div class=\"blab\">In other words</div><div><b>Step 1</b> — the receptionist asks the five questions: name (and spelling!), nationality, job, why you are here, email address.</div><div><b>Step 2</b> — small talk: ask about their day (What time do you…?), their work (Do you like…?) and their last holiday (Where did you go?).</div><div><b>Step 3</b> — swap roles. Then tell your teacher TWO things about your teacher.</div></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Type it\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 10 &middot; Type it</div>\n      <h2>Type it</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">Now produce it — type, don’t tap.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\">Spelling counts. Type the answers, then check.</p>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l12s9t1\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">I ___ born in Astana. (be)<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"was\" placeholder=\"Type the missing word…\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">She ___ in a hospital. (work)<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"works\" placeholder=\"Type the missing word…\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">___ you have a good weekend?<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"Did\" placeholder=\"Type the missing word…\"></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>Review: was/were \\u00b7 he/she + -s \\u00b7 Did + base verb \\u00b7 polite Could you\\u2026?</p></div>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l12s9t2\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">Did you went to the class?<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"Did you go to the class?\" placeholder=\"Type the whole correct sentence…\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">She have a shower at seven.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"She has a shower at seven.\" placeholder=\"Type the whole correct sentence…\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">He don't work on Sundays.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"He doesn't work on Sundays.\" placeholder=\"Type the whole correct sentence…\"></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>Review: was/were \\u00b7 he/she + -s \\u00b7 Did + base verb \\u00b7 polite Could you\\u2026?</p></div>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l12s9t3\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">Make a question: You were at home.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"Were you at home?\" placeholder=\"Type the new sentence…\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">Change to SHE: I go to work at nine.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"She goes to work at nine.\" placeholder=\"Type the new sentence…\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">Make it polite: Send me the form.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"Could you send me the form, please?|Can you send me the form, please?\" placeholder=\"Type the new sentence…\"></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>Review: was/were \\u00b7 he/she + -s \\u00b7 Did + base verb \\u00b7 polite Could you\\u2026?</p></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Done\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 11 &middot; Done</div>\n      <h2>Done</h2>\n    </div>\n\n  </section>\n\n"}